(Attention-Driven Multi-Scale Representation Learning for Document Intelligence) Tj
T*
(Dr. Elena Vance, Dr. Marcus Thorne, Sophia Lin) Tj
T*
(Department of Computer Science, Institute of Advanced Technology) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ABSTRACT) Tj
T*
(Academic document understanding requires joint reasoning over dense typographic layouts and semantic text.) Tj
T*
(Existing vision-language models frequently suffer from spatial misalignment and high computational complexity.) Tj
T*
(In this work, we present DocScale, a novel multi-scale self-attention architecture tailored for document parsing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. INTRODUCTION AND PROBLEM STATEMENT) Tj
T*
(Academic and scientific PDFs present unique challenges due to multi-column formats, mathematical equations, and inline figures.) Tj
T*
(Current optical character pipelines and transformer models struggle with boundary detection across contiguous pages.) Tj
T*
(Specifically, existing baselines fail to maintain cross-page continuity, resulting in a 24.3% error rate in multi-page reasoning.) Tj
T*
(Our primary objective is to resolve spatial degradation while reducing model parameter footprint by 35% without sacrificing accuracy.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
