BT
/F1 11 Tf
50 750 Td
16 TL
(2. METHODOLOGY AND ARCHITECTURE) Tj
T*
(DocScale incorporates a hierarchical cross-attention mechanism that decouples layout spatial coordinates from lexical embeddings.) Tj
T*
(The architecture consists of 12 encoder layers equipped with relative positional bias and gated visual pooling.) Tj
T*
(By computing cross-attention over multi-scale feature pyramids, the model preserves fine-grained token boundaries.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. DATASET AND EXPERIMENTAL SETUP) Tj
T*
(We evaluate DocScale on the newly curated SciDoc-50k benchmark, consisting of 50,000 open-access peer-reviewed papers.) Tj
T*
(The dataset spans four major scientific domains: Computer Science, Physics, Bioengineering, and Computational Linguistics.) Tj
T*
(Data preprocessing involved standard normalization and filtering of documents with fewer than 100 tokens.) Tj
T*
(All models were trained on 8 NVIDIA A100 GPUs using AdamW optimizer with a learning rate of 2e-4 and cosine decay.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
